WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.984 --> 00:00:05.605
Roxy ran into an empty room.

2
00:00:05.625 --> 00:00:09.246
A moment later she was Rocket Girl!

3
00:00:32.524 --> 00:00:36.265
Sometimes Roxy felt bad that her friends didn't know she was actually Rocket Girl.

4
00:00:37.845 --> 00:00:41.907
But Roxy had decided to tell her secret only to Mayor Bloom and Principal Penn.

5
00:00:44.447 --> 00:00:46.328
That way she could still have a normal life.

6
00:00:47.328 --> 00:00:48.548
Well, sort of normal.

7
00:00:49.569 --> 00:00:51.929
How many eight-year-olds had to save the world every day?

8
00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:54.990
But now was not the time to worry about that.

9
00:00:55.930 --> 00:00:57.391
Rocket Girl had a job to do!

10
00:00:58.811 --> 00:01:01.392
Roxy ran down the hall and out the front door of the school.

11
00:01:02.884 --> 00:01:04.285
"Okay," she said.

12
00:01:04.305 --> 00:01:06.966
"It's time to figure out what landed at Mr.

13
00:01:07.006 --> 00:01:07.746
Mann's farm."

14
00:01:08.706 --> 00:01:10.387
Then Roxy blasted into the air.

15
00:01:10.407 --> 00:01:13.889
"Look out the window!"

16
00:01:14.269 --> 00:01:14.869
cried Mara.

17
00:01:14.889 --> 00:01:16.630
"Rocket Girl!"

18
00:01:17.070 --> 00:01:17.690
said Terrell.

19
00:01:23.393 --> 00:01:24.893
Soon Roxy was at Mr.

20
00:01:24.913 --> 00:01:25.553
Mann's farm.

21
00:01:26.754 --> 00:01:27.554
She looked around.

22
00:01:29.795 --> 00:01:31.256
Some of the corn had been cut down.

23
00:01:32.744 --> 00:01:34.284
Roxy didn't see the spaceship though.

24
00:01:35.145 --> 00:01:37.125
Just then something moved in the cornfield.

25
00:01:38.266 --> 00:01:39.526
A figure stepped toward her.

26
00:01:44.007 --> 00:01:44.727
"Oh no!"

27
00:01:45.168 --> 00:01:45.928
Roxy laughed.

28
00:01:46.468 --> 00:01:47.928
"It's an alien detective!"

29
00:01:47.948 --> 00:01:53.290
"This is no time for making jokes," said Detective Smith with a frown.

30
00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:56.551
Detective Smith was Metro City's head detective.

31
00:01:57.631 --> 00:01:59.031
He was a very serious man.

32
00:02:00.152 --> 00:02:01.032
He never joked.

33
00:02:02.752 --> 00:02:04.273
"Fine," said Roxy.

34
00:02:04.293 --> 00:02:06.395
"So what happened here?

35
00:02:07.216 --> 00:02:08.257
Where's the spaceship?"

36
00:02:09.558 --> 00:02:11.579
"I don't know," said Detective Smith.

37
00:02:11.599 --> 00:02:13.701
"I looked all over for it.

38
00:02:14.702 --> 00:02:15.783
I didn't see it anywhere."

39
00:02:15.803 --> 00:02:18.064
"Did Mr.

40
00:02:18.124 --> 00:02:19.185
Mann see where it went?"

41
00:02:19.586 --> 00:02:20.226
asked Roxy.

42
00:02:20.246 --> 00:02:22.888
"No," said Detective Smith.

43
00:02:22.908 --> 00:02:25.390
"He got scared and ran into his house.

44
00:02:26.131 --> 00:02:27.652
He told me he hid under his bed.

45
00:02:28.513 --> 00:02:30.854
When he came back out, the spaceship was gone.

46
00:02:31.695 --> 00:02:32.456
So was the corn."

47
00:02:34.144 --> 00:02:36.345
"Why would the aliens take the corn?"

48
00:02:36.705 --> 00:02:37.465
Roxy wondered.

49
00:02:38.285 --> 00:02:39.165
She looked around.

50
00:02:40.366 --> 00:02:42.906
She saw a tree with a broken branch and flew over to it.

51
00:02:42.926 --> 00:02:47.808
"It looks like something crashed into this tree," thought Roxy.

52
00:02:48.608 --> 00:02:50.469
Nearby, a fence was also broken.

53
00:02:51.249 --> 00:02:53.089
Roxy looked from the tree to the fence.

54
00:02:54.069 --> 00:02:55.430
Then she looked past the fence.

55
00:02:56.690 --> 00:02:58.631
She could see a trail of damaged trees.

56
00:02:58.651 --> 00:03:03.072
"I bet the spaceship did that," thought Roxy.

57
00:03:04.056 --> 00:03:07.139
"But why didn't the spaceship fly over all the trees?

58
00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:09.582
And where did the spaceship go?"

59
00:03:10.763 --> 00:03:12.765
Roxy flew up high to get a better view.

60
00:03:13.626 --> 00:03:17.349
The trail led straight toward Roxy gulped.

61
00:03:18.691 --> 00:03:21.914
"Uh-oh! I know exactly where the spaceship went.

62
00:03:25.858 --> 00:03:27.960
It's headed toward downtown Metro City!"
